"""Derivation checks for the one record list that declares every cinbase
setting (ticket 02 of the 2026-11-13 architecture review).

A setting lives in ``CONFIG_RECORDS`` exactly once
(``python/cinbase/config.py``); everything else is a projection of it:
the ``CinBaseConfig.__init__`` defaults, the shipped
``python/input_methods/<ime>/config/config.json`` of every Service, the
settings-page surface (``python/cinbase/config/config.htm`` scripted by
``js/config.js``, which reads the list off ``/config``), and the
``checkConfigChange`` reload diff. These checks pin each projection
against the list; the orphan keys ``keyboardLayout``, ``colorCandWnd`` and
``directCommitString`` are the end-to-end demo of one row propagating.
"""

